      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get that it's complicated, but I'm not looking for a definitive political science thesis. I just need a general sense of the landscape for my production planning. Like, if I'm looking at tension in places like Georgia or Azerbaijan, are there certain organized groups or parties that the international community generally views as \"pro-stability/moderate\" versus the groups that are considered \"instability-drivers\" or extremists? I just want to know which vibes I should steer clear of to avoid getting stuck in a protest or something.",
